   205	  after `ended_at`).
   206	- **Public view.** ACCEPTED shows `attempt` {number, of, state} and, for an open attempt, `expiry_boundary` (B) with a
   207	  note that the twelve-day budget is nominal; REFUSED lists each attempt's outcome and reason.

